        "rationale": "Change A promises one receipt per successful charge. Change B renames the event that charge() publishes to payment.captured, but receipts.install still subscribes to charge.succeeded. After the merge, charging an order end to end sends no receipt. The two tests here go through charge() rather than publishing the event by hand, as A's own tests do."
